<title>NETHERLANDS: ECT sees 1997 result in line with 1996.</title>
<headline>ECT sees 1997 result in line with 1996.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Europe Combined Terminals (ECT) said on Wednesday its 1996 net profit was 40 million guilders and it expected 1997 results to be in line with 1996's.  </p>
<p>For 1997 ECT foresees an increase in turnover of about eight percent.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
